       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-TEDDY_BEAR-CAM.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-TEDDY_BEAR-CAM-PROOFS.
           05  WS-CHASSIS-ASSEMBLY-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CLOCKWORK-CLAW-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LENS-ALIGNMENT-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TEDDY_BEAR-CAM-LATENCY-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TEDDY_BEAR-CAM-SEAL-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-TEDDY_BEAR-CAM-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PT8-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PT8-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-CHASSIS-AND-CLAW.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-LENS-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PT8-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-CHASSIS-AND-CLAW.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CHASSIS-ASSEMBLY-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CLOCKWORK-CLAW-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-LENS-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LENS-ALIGNMENT-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TEDDY_BEAR-CAM-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PT8-PROOFS.
           IF WS-CHASSIS-ASSEMBLY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CLOCKWORK-CLAW-OK = 1 AND
              WS-LENS-ALIGNMENT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-TEDDY_BEAR-CAM-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TEDDY_BEAR-CAM-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PT8-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PT8-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PT8-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PT8-CODE.
